Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,H_id,,0,0,0,,"Kamu takut dia kembali HIDUP?"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.22,S_id,,0,0,0,,Shen Zhenzhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:03.61,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sejak kejadian menimpa Shen Nian,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.33,S_id,,0,0,0,,kamu terus berusaha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.93,S_id,,0,0,0,,untuk menghentikan pencarian dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:09.94,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tidak, bukan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:14.08,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu takut apa sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.08,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu takut dia kembali hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.12,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku hanya menerima kenyataan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.76,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kakaknya sudah mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.36,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah lama ditelan hiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.57,S_id,,0,0,0,,Begitu ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.36,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, berdoalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.27,S_id,,0,0,0,,Berdoa agar dia benar-benar mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Karena dia mungkin masih hidup.
